stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: Order Lifecycle
    accDescr: State transitions for an e-commerce order

    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Submitted : submit()
    Submitted --> UnderReview : assign reviewer
    UnderReview --> Approved : approve()
    UnderReview --> Rejected : reject()
    Approved --> Fulfilled : fulfill()
    Fulfilled --> [*]
    Rejected --> Draft : revise()
    Rejected --> [*] : cancel()
